WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.086
LU1 formative knowledge check Try the separate ten-question formative

00:00:05.113 --> 00:00:09.192
knowledge check The default pass mark is eighty percent

00:00:09.613 --> 00:00:12.692
with three total submissions per question and two total

00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:17.072
quiz attempts There are no penalties or partial marks

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.428
After a failed first quiz you must review the

00:00:20.507 --> 00:00:23.586
relevant teaching and make a fresh practice response before

00:00:23.652 --> 00:00:28.126
the one permitted retry Embedded practice remains ungraded and

00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:33.547
does not consume these attempts Answer scenario-based questions use

00:00:33.613 --> 00:00:37.876
permitted question retries and receive feedback On a failed

00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:41.507
quiz revisit the relevant teaching before the proposed single

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.534
whole-quiz retry
